-- Japan: Act No. 53 of 2025 (令和七年法律第五十三号) -- INDEPENDENT TESTS.
-- A DRAFT. Not for use as advice.
--
-- Written by a session that did not see the encoding being built. Every expected
-- value was decided from the deposited sources (ai-act-ja.txt, authoritative;
-- ai-act-en.txt, aid; egov-law-revisions.json for the e-Gov enforcement date)
-- and written down BEFORE the encoding was opened; the encoding was then read
-- only to learn its names. No expectation was adjusted to match the code.
-- A failing assertion here is a finding, left failing on purpose; each one
-- carries a comment naming the provision and the reading behind it.

§ `Independent fixtures`

-- Technology (Article 2): limb (A) only, limb (B) only, neither.
`indep: cognition-substituting technology` MEANS `The technology` WITH
    `technology necessary for realizing the function of substituting, by artificial means, intellectual abilities relating to human cognition, inference and judgement` IS TRUE
    `technology relating to an information processing system that processes input information using that technology and outputs the result` IS FALSE

`indep: an information processing system using it` MEANS `The technology` WITH
    `technology necessary for realizing the function of substituting, by artificial means, intellectual abilities relating to human cognition, inference and judgement` IS FALSE
    `technology relating to an information processing system that processes input information using that technology and outputs the result` IS TRUE

`indep: ordinary software` MEANS `The technology` WITH
    `technology necessary for realizing the function of substituting, by artificial means, intellectual abilities relating to human cognition, inference and judgement` IS FALSE
    `technology relating to an information processing system that processes input information using that technology and outputs the result` IS FALSE

-- Businesses (Article 7; Article 6(1); Article 25(1)).
`indep: a provider of an AI service who does not otherwise use AI` MEANS `The business` WITH
    `develops or provides, or intends to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology` IS TRUE
    `uses, or intends to use, the technology in its business activities` IS FALSE
    `a university, a research and development corporation, or another institute that researches and develops the technology` IS FALSE
    `the head of a relevant administrative body, local government or incorporated administrative agency, or the representative of a special corporation` IS FALSE

`indep: a shop that only uses AI in its operations` MEANS `The business` WITH
    `develops or provides, or intends to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology` IS FALSE
    `uses, or intends to use, the technology in its business activities` IS TRUE
    `a university, a research and development corporation, or another institute that researches and develops the technology` IS FALSE
    `the head of a relevant administrative body, local government or incorporated administrative agency, or the representative of a special corporation` IS FALSE

`indep: a business that neither makes nor uses AI` MEANS `The business` WITH
    `develops or provides, or intends to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology` IS FALSE
    `uses, or intends to use, the technology in its business activities` IS FALSE
    `a university, a research and development corporation, or another institute that researches and develops the technology` IS FALSE
    `the head of a relevant administrative body, local government or incorporated administrative agency, or the representative of a special corporation` IS FALSE

-- A special corporation (Article 25(1)) that also uses AI in its business, so is
-- also a utilization business operator (Article 7).
`indep: a special corporation that uses AI` MEANS `The business` WITH
    `develops or provides, or intends to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology` IS FALSE
    `uses, or intends to use, the technology in its business activities` IS TRUE
    `a university, a research and development corporation, or another institute that researches and develops the technology` IS FALSE
    `the head of a relevant administrative body, local government or incorporated administrative agency, or the representative of a special corporation` IS TRUE

-- A company that develops AI and is also (fork F6, stated as a fact) an institute.
`indep: an AI lab company that is also an institute` MEANS `The business` WITH
    `develops or provides, or intends to develop or provide, products or services that use the technology` IS TRUE
    `uses, or intends to use, the technology in its business activities` IS TRUE
    `a university, a research and development corporation, or another institute that researches and develops the technology` IS TRUE
    `the head of a relevant administrative body, local government or incorporated administrative agency, or the representative of a special corporation` IS FALSE

-- Incidents (Article 16).
`indep: rights infringed through a wrongful purpose` MEANS `The incident` WITH
    `citizens' rights and interests were infringed` IS TRUE
    `arose from research and development or utilization of the technology for a wrongful purpose` IS TRUE
    `arose from research and development or utilization of the technology by an inappropriate method` IS FALSE

`indep: rights infringed through an inappropriate method` MEANS `The incident` WITH
    `citizens' rights and interests were infringed` IS TRUE
    `arose from research and development or utilization of the technology for a wrongful purpose` IS FALSE
    `arose from research and development or utilization of the technology by an inappropriate method` IS TRUE

`indep: a malfunction that infringed nobody's rights` MEANS `The incident` WITH
    `citizens' rights and interests were infringed` IS FALSE
    `arose from research and development or utilization of the technology for a wrongful purpose` IS FALSE
    `arose from research and development or utilization of the technology by an inappropriate method` IS TRUE

`indep: rights infringed with no wrongful purpose or inappropriate method` MEANS `The incident` WITH
    `citizens' rights and interests were infringed` IS TRUE
    `arose from research and development or utilization of the technology for a wrongful purpose` IS FALSE
    `arose from research and development or utilization of the technology by an inappropriate method` IS FALSE

-- Measures (Articles 4, 5, 7, 25).
`indep: a national measure under Article 4` MEANS `The measure` WITH
    `implemented by the national government under Article 4` IS TRUE
    `implemented by a local government under Article 5` IS FALSE
    `a request for cooperation from the Artificial Intelligence Strategic Headquarters` IS FALSE

`indep: a local measure under Article 5` MEANS `The measure` WITH
    `implemented by the national government under Article 4` IS FALSE
    `implemented by a local government under Article 5` IS TRUE
    `a request for cooperation from the Artificial Intelligence Strategic Headquarters` IS FALSE

`indep: a measure under some other law` MEANS `The measure` WITH
    `implemented by the national government under Article 4` IS FALSE
    `implemented by a local government under Article 5` IS FALSE
    `a request for cooperation from the Artificial Intelligence Strategic Headquarters` IS FALSE

`indep: a Headquarters request not said to be an Article 4 measure` MEANS `The measure` WITH
    `implemented by the national government under Article 4` IS FALSE
    `implemented by a local government under Article 5` IS FALSE
    `a request for cooperation from the Artificial Intelligence Strategic Headquarters` IS TRUE

`indep: a Headquarters request made as an Article 4 measure` MEANS `The measure` WITH
    `implemented by the national government under Article 4` IS TRUE
    `implemented by a local government under Article 5` IS FALSE
    `a request for cooperation from the Artificial Intelligence Strategic Headquarters` IS TRUE

