§ `(a) No reporting duty on a business operator`

-- Every row, Articles 1-28 and the Supplementary Provisions: none carries any
-- mechanism toward a private person (my table in answers-first, section (a)).
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD (NOT (any (GIVEN m YIELD TRUE) (p's `mechanisms affecting a private person`)))) `the provisions of the Act`
#ASSERT (NOT (`some provision carries` `a duty to report an incident or a case to an authority` `the provisions of the Act`))
-- Article 16 cases: the State analyses them; the business owes no report.
#ASSERT `must the business report the incident` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: rights infringed through a wrongful purpose` `the provisions of the Act` EQUALS `no provision of this Act requires me to report it; the national government is to analyze cases like this one (Article 16)`
#ASSERT `must the business report the incident` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: rights infringed through an inappropriate method` `the provisions of the Act` EQUALS `no provision of this Act requires me to report it; the national government is to analyze cases like this one (Article 16)`
#ASSERT `must the business report the incident` `indep: 2025-06-04` `indep: rights infringed through a wrongful purpose` `the provisions of the Act` EQUALS `no provision of this Act requires me to report it; the national government is to analyze cases like this one (Article 16)`
-- Not Article 16 cases (no infringement; or no wrongful purpose / inappropriate method).
#ASSERT `must the business report the incident` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: a malfunction that infringed nobody's rights` `the provisions of the Act` EQUALS `no provision of this Act requires me to report it`
#ASSERT `must the business report the incident` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: rights infringed with no wrongful purpose or inappropriate method` `the provisions of the Act` EQUALS `no provision of this Act requires me to report it`
-- Before promulgation nothing in the Act is in force.
#ASSERT `must the business report the incident` `indep: 2025-06-03` `indep: rights infringed through a wrongful purpose` `the provisions of the Act` EQUALS `this Act was not yet in force`
-- The baseline question, plain inputs.
#ASSERT `Must I report an AI incident to the government under this Act` `indep: 2026-10-24` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no provision of this Act requires me to report it; the national government is to analyze cases like this one (Article 16)`
#ASSERT `Must I report an AI incident to the government under this Act` `indep: 2026-10-24` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no provision of this Act requires me to report it`

§ `(b) No penalty, naming, investigation, order, inspection, or duty to comply with a request`

#ASSERT `can the business be penalised, reading` `the provisions of the Act` EQUALS `this Act contains no penalty, fine or other sanction`
#ASSERT `can the business be named, reading` `the provisions of the Act` EQUALS `no provision of this Act provides for publishing my name`
#ASSERT `can the business be investigated or ordered, reading` `the provisions of the Act` EQUALS `no provision of this Act lets the government investigate or inspect me, order me, or require me to comply with a request`
#ASSERT (NOT (`some provision carries` `a penalty, fine or other sanction` `the provisions of the Act`))
#ASSERT (NOT (`some provision carries` `publication of a person's name` `the provisions of the Act`))
#ASSERT (NOT (`some provision carries` `an investigation, inspection or order addressed to a private person` `the provisions of the Act`))
#ASSERT (NOT (`some provision carries` `a duty to comply with a request` `the provisions of the Act`))
-- Article 18(4)'s 公表 makes the AI Basic Plan public, not a person's name.
#ASSERT (NOT (elem `publication of a person's name` (`Article 18`'s `mechanisms affecting a private person`)))
-- Article 16's 調査 is the State's own research; its 指導・助言 carry no duty to follow.
#ASSERT (NOT (elem `an investigation, inspection or order addressed to a private person` (`Article 16`'s `mechanisms affecting a private person`)))
#ASSERT (NOT (elem `publication of a person's name` (`Article 16`'s `mechanisms affecting a private person`)))
#ASSERT (NOT (elem `a duty to comply with a request` (`Article 16`'s `mechanisms affecting a private person`)))
-- Article 13's guidelines: no duty to follow them is stated.
#ASSERT (NOT (elem `a duty to comply with a request` (`Article 13`'s `mechanisms affecting a private person`)))
-- Article 25: a power to request (1) and to ask (2); no duty to comply attached.
#ASSERT (NOT (elem `a duty to comply with a request` (`Article 25(1)`'s `mechanisms affecting a private person`)))
#ASSERT (NOT (elem `a duty to comply with a request` (`Article 25(2)`'s `mechanisms affecting a private person`)))
-- The baseline questions, on both sides of promulgation (the answer does not move).
#ASSERT `Can I be fined or penalised under this Act` `indep: 2026-10-24` EQUALS `this Act contains no penalty, fine or other sanction`
#ASSERT `Can the government publicly name me under this Act` `indep: 2026-10-24` EQUALS `no provision of this Act provides for publishing my name`
#ASSERT `Can the government investigate or order me under this Act` `indep: 2026-10-24` EQUALS `no provision of this Act lets the government investigate or inspect me, order me, or require me to comply with a request`
#ASSERT `Can I be fined or penalised under this Act` `indep: 2025-06-03` EQUALS `this Act contains no penalty, fine or other sanction`

§ `(c) Verb force`

-- Article 7: first limb 努める (endeavour), second limb 協力しなければならない (must cooperate).
#ASSERT `Article 7`'s `the verb form` EQUALS `endeavor, and must cooperate (努めるとともに、協力しなければならない)`
#ASSERT `Article 7`'s `addressed to` EQUALS `utilization business operators (活用事業者)`
#ASSERT `Article 7`'s `what it means for a business operator` EQUALS `an endeavor, and a duty to cooperate`
-- Article 6(1): institutes only ENDEAVOUR to cooperate (協力するよう努めるものとする).
#ASSERT `Article 6(1)`'s `the verb form` EQUALS `is to endeavor, and is to endeavor to cooperate (努めるとともに、協力するよう努めるものとする)`
#ASSERT `Article 6(3)`'s `the verb form` EQUALS `is to endeavor (努めるものとする)`
#ASSERT `Article 6(1)`'s `addressed to` EQUALS `research and development institutes (研究開発機関)`
-- Article 8: citizens, cooperation is an endeavour; not operator-facing.
#ASSERT `Article 8`'s `addressed to` EQUALS `citizens (国民)`
#ASSERT `Article 8`'s `what it means for a business operator` EQUALS `none: not addressed to a business operator`
-- The contrast that matters: operators MUST, institutes and citizens ENDEAVOUR.
#ASSERT (NOT (`Article 7`'s `the verb form` EQUALS `Article 6(1)`'s `the verb form`))
#ASSERT (NOT (`Article 7`'s `the verb form` EQUALS `Article 8`'s `the verb form`))
-- Article 6(2): addressed to national and local government, not to operators.
#ASSERT `Article 6(2)`'s `addressed to` EQUALS `the national government and local governments (国及び地方公共団体)`
#ASSERT `Article 6(2)`'s `the verb form` EQUALS `endeavor, and must give due consideration (努めるとともに、配慮しなければならない)`
-- Article 3: (1)-(3) ものとする with no person; (4) passive must, addressee unnamed (government's measures); (5) Japan endeavours.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD p's `the verb form` EQUALS `is to (ものとする)`) (LIST `Article 3(1)`, `Article 3(2)`, `Article 3(3)`)
#ASSERT `Article 3(4)`'s `the verb form` EQUALS `measures must be taken, in the passive (講じられなければならない)`
#ASSERT (NOT (`Article 3(4)`'s `addressed to` EQUALS `utilization business operators (活用事業者)`))
#ASSERT `Article 3(5)`'s `addressed to` EQUALS `Japan (我が国)`
#ASSERT `Article 3(5)`'s `the verb form` EQUALS `is to endeavor (努めるものとする)`
-- Articles 4(1) and 5: 責務を有する.
#ASSERT `Article 4(1)`'s `the verb form` EQUALS `is responsible for (責務を有する)`
#ASSERT `Article 5`'s `the verb form` EQUALS `is responsible for (責務を有する)`
-- Article 7 is the only provision addressed to operators.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD (NOT (p's `addressed to` EQUALS `utilization business operators (活用事業者)`)) OR p's `the provision` EQUALS "Article 7") `the provisions of the Act`
-- Operator-mentioning Chapter I-II provisions (9, 12, 14, 16, also 13) are the State's: 講ずるものとする, no verb on operators.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD p's `addressed to` EQUALS `the national government (国)` AND p's `the verb form` EQUALS `is to (ものとする)`) (LIST `Article 9`, `Article 12`, `Article 13`, `Article 14`, `Article 16`)
-- Article 25: (1) 求めることができる "may request"; (2) 依頼することができる "may ask for".
#ASSERT `Article 25(1)`'s `the verb form` EQUALS `may request (求めることができる)`
#ASSERT `Article 25(2)`'s `the verb form` EQUALS `may ask for (依頼することができる)`
#ASSERT (NOT (`Article 25(1)`'s `the verb form` EQUALS `Article 25(2)`'s `the verb form`))
-- Operator-level: Article 7's second limb is a duty with no sanction.
#ASSERT `Article 7: must the business cooperate with the measure` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: a provider of an AI service who does not otherwise use AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a national measure under Article 4` EQUALS `I must cooperate with the measure (Article 7, 協力しなければならない), and the Act states no sanction for not cooperating`
#ASSERT `Article 7: must the business cooperate with the measure` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: a shop that only uses AI in its operations` `indep: an information processing system using it` `indep: a local measure under Article 5` EQUALS `I must cooperate with the measure (Article 7, 協力しなければならない), and the Act states no sanction for not cooperating`
#ASSERT `Article 7: must the business cooperate with the measure` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: a provider of an AI service who does not otherwise use AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a measure under some other law` EQUALS `Article 7 does not reach this measure: it is not implemented by the national government under Article 4 or by a local government under Article 5`
#ASSERT `Article 7: must the business cooperate with the measure` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: a business that neither makes nor uses AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a national measure under Article 4` EQUALS `Article 7's duty to cooperate does not apply: not a utilization business operator`
#ASSERT `Article 7: must the business cooperate with the measure` `indep: 2025-06-03` `indep: a provider of an AI service who does not otherwise use AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a national measure under Article 4` EQUALS `Article 7's duty to cooperate was not yet in force`
#ASSERT `Article 7: must the business cooperate with the measure` `indep: 2025-06-04` `indep: a provider of an AI service who does not otherwise use AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a national measure under Article 4` EQUALS `I must cooperate with the measure (Article 7, 協力しなければならない), and the Act states no sanction for not cooperating`
-- Article 7's first limb: an endeavour, from promulgation.
#ASSERT `Article 7: what the business is to endeavor to do` `indep: 2025-06-04` `indep: a shop that only uses AI in its operations` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` EQUALS `I am to endeavor to make my business activities more efficient and advanced, and to create new industries, by actively using the technology`
#ASSERT `Article 7: what the business is to endeavor to do` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: a business that neither makes nor uses AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` EQUALS `Article 7's endeavor does not apply: not a utilization business operator`
#ASSERT `Article 7: what the business is to endeavor to do` `indep: 2025-06-03` `indep: a shop that only uses AI in its operations` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` EQUALS `Article 7's endeavor was not yet in force`
-- Article 6 for a company that is also an institute: endeavours only.
#ASSERT `Article 6: what the business is to endeavor to do as a research and development institute` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: an AI lab company that is also an institute` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` EQUALS `I am to endeavor to research, develop and disseminate, to develop human resources, to endeavor to cooperate with Article 4 and Article 5 measures, and to endeavor to do interdisciplinary research`
#ASSERT `Article 6: what the business is to endeavor to do as a research and development institute` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: a shop that only uses AI in its operations` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` EQUALS `Article 6 does not apply: not a research and development institute`
-- Such a company is still an operator, so Article 7's stronger duty also reaches it.
#ASSERT `Article 7: must the business cooperate with the measure` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: an AI lab company that is also an institute` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a national measure under Article 4` EQUALS `I must cooperate with the measure (Article 7, 協力しなければならない), and the Act states no sanction for not cooperating`
-- Baseline, plain inputs.
#ASSERT `Must I cooperate with this government measure` `indep: 2026-10-24` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `I must cooperate with the measure (Article 7, 協力しなければならない), and the Act states no sanction for not cooperating`
#ASSERT `Must I cooperate with this government measure` `indep: 2026-10-24` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `Article 7's duty to cooperate does not apply: not a utilization business operator`

