§ `(e) Article 25`

-- A private operator that is not a special corporation: 25(2) only, no duty.
#ASSERT `Article 25: what the Headquarters may ask of the business` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: the e-Gov Cabinet Order day` `indep: a provider of an AI service who does not otherwise use AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a Headquarters request not said to be an Article 4 measure` EQUALS `the Headquarters may ask me for necessary cooperation if it finds it particularly necessary (Article 25(2)); Article 25 states no duty to comply`
-- A business that is not an operator is still "a person other than" 25(1)'s, and Article 7 cannot reach it.
#ASSERT `Article 25: what the Headquarters may ask of the business` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: the e-Gov Cabinet Order day` `indep: a business that neither makes nor uses AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a Headquarters request made as an Article 4 measure` EQUALS `the Headquarters may ask me for necessary cooperation if it finds it particularly necessary (Article 25(2)); Article 25 states no duty to comply`
-- An operator told the request is an Article 4 measure: Article 7 applies by its terms (fork F5, reading A on the stated fact).
#ASSERT `Article 25: what the Headquarters may ask of the business` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: the e-Gov Cabinet Order day` `indep: a provider of an AI service who does not otherwise use AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a Headquarters request made as an Article 4 measure` EQUALS `the Headquarters may ask me for necessary cooperation if it finds it particularly necessary (Article 25(2)); and if the request is an Article 4 measure, Article 7 says I must cooperate`
-- A special corporation: 25(1), "may request" materials, opinions, explanations; no duty to comply in Article 25.
#ASSERT `Article 25: what the Headquarters may ask of the business` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: the e-Gov Cabinet Order day` `indep: a special corporation that uses AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a Headquarters request not said to be an Article 4 measure` EQUALS `the Headquarters may request materials, opinions, explanations or other cooperation if it finds it necessary (Article 25(1)); Article 25 states no duty to comply`
-- EXPECTED TO FAIL (finding). A special corporation that uses AI in its business is also an
-- Article 7 operator, so when it is told a request is an Article 4 measure, Article 7 bears on it
-- exactly as it does on a 25(2) operator; the answer should therefore move with that fact, as the
-- 25(2) branch does. The encoding's 25(1) branch ignores Article 7. (Art 7, ja:30; Art 25(1), ja:80.)
#ASSERT (NOT (`Article 25: what the Headquarters may ask of the business` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: the e-Gov Cabinet Order day` `indep: a special corporation that uses AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a Headquarters request made as an Article 4 measure` EQUALS `Article 25: what the Headquarters may ask of the business` `indep: 2026-10-24` `indep: the e-Gov Cabinet Order day` `indep: a special corporation that uses AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a Headquarters request not said to be an Article 4 measure`))
-- EXPECTED TO FAIL (finding). Article 25(1) reaches "the representative of a special corporation"
-- (特殊法人…の代表者), and a special corporation can be a utilization business operator; the row's
-- bearing should not be "none: not addressed to a business operator". (ja:80; en 313-328.)
#ASSERT (NOT (`Article 25(1)`'s `what it means for a business operator` EQUALS `none: not addressed to a business operator`))
#ASSERT `Article 25(2)`'s `what it means for a business operator` EQUALS `the Headquarters may ask the business for cooperation`
#ASSERT `Article 25(2)`'s `part` EQUALS `Chapter IV, Artificial Intelligence Strategic Headquarters`
-- Commencement edges for Article 25 (Chapter IV), with the e-Gov day.
#ASSERT `Article 25: what the Headquarters may ask of the business` `indep: 2025-08-31` `indep: the e-Gov Cabinet Order day` `indep: a provider of an AI service who does not otherwise use AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a Headquarters request not said to be an Article 4 measure` EQUALS `Article 25 was not yet in force`
#ASSERT `Article 25: what the Headquarters may ask of the business` `indep: 2025-09-01` `indep: the e-Gov Cabinet Order day` `indep: a provider of an AI service who does not otherwise use AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a Headquarters request not said to be an Article 4 measure` EQUALS `the Headquarters may ask me for necessary cooperation if it finds it particularly necessary (Article 25(2)); Article 25 states no duty to comply`
-- Article 25 did not commence on promulgation: Chapter IV waits for the Cabinet Order day.
#ASSERT `Article 25: what the Headquarters may ask of the business` `indep: 2025-06-04` `indep: the e-Gov Cabinet Order day` `indep: a provider of an AI service who does not otherwise use AI` `indep: cognition-substituting technology` `indep: a Headquarters request not said to be an Article 4 measure` EQUALS `Article 25 was not yet in force`
